ûúûú.ûúòãJòJò␀óóôKñx[key: ROPE, proc: Commander.CommandProc, doc: ROPE _ NIL, clientData: REF ANY _ NIL, interpreted: BOOL _ TRUE]öú™ò™Kò␀Kñx[key: ROPE, proc: Commander.CommandProc, doc: ROPE _ NIL, clientData: REF ANY _ NIL, interpreted: BOOL _ TRUE]öú¿ò¿Kò␀öú¢ò¢Jò␀óñx[key: ROPE, proc: Commander.CommandProc, doc: ROPE _ NIL, clientData: REF ANY _ NIL, interpreted: BOOL _ TRUE]öú∏ò∏Jò␀óñx[key: ROPE, proc: Commander.CommandProc, doc: ROPE _ NIL, clientData: REF ANY _ NIL, interpreted: BOOL _ TRUE]öú∂ò∂Jò␀óñx[key: ROPE, proc: Commander.CommandProc, doc: ROPE _ NIL, clientData: REF ANY _ NIL, interpreted: BOOL _ TRUE]öú–ò–Jò␀óóKöûúòó␀Öó␀␀␀␀$H␀␀5«␀␀